  n=4: Trying H(t) = det(I_k + M(t)) for various k
    n=4: univariate H(p) = 1 + 8p - 4p²
    = det(I_2 + p·A) where A has eigenvalues 4+2sqrt(5), 4-2sqrt(5)
    = (1 + (4+2√5)p)(1 + (4-2√5)p)
    This works for the UNIVARIATE version H(p,...,p)!

